Using Chempy
Chempy handles:


from chempy import Substance
Molecular masses:


mm = Substance.from_formula("H2SO4").mass
No need for manual element tables.
Reaction parsing:


from chempy import Reaction
 
rxn = Reaction.from_string(
    "2 H2 + O2 -> 2 H2O"
)
Can verify stoichiometric coefficients automatically.
